WEBVTT

00:12.360 --> 00:14.703
<i>This just in:
New evidence that</i>
<i>这只是在：
新证据表明</i>

00:14.704 --> 00:17.910
<i>unidentified flying objects
have been secretly visiting</i>
<i>不明飞行物
曾秘密拜访过</i>

00:17.911 --> 00:19.772
<i>Bikini Bottom for years.</i>
<i>多年来比基尼泳裤。</i>

00:19.773 --> 00:23.014
General, what are the
chances that these photos
一般情况下，有哪些
有可能这些照片

00:23.015 --> 00:24.841
and videos are just a hoax?
视频只是一个骗局？

00:24.842 --> 00:29.427
99.99999%.
99.99999%。
99.99999%。
99.99999%。

00:29.428 --> 00:31.221
<i>There you have it--</i>
<i>给你了--</i>

00:31.222 --> 00:36.083
<i>conclusive proof that
there is a 0.00001% chance</i>
<i>确凿的证据表明
有 0.00001% 的机会</i>

00:36.084 --> 00:38.772
<i>UFOs are real.</i>
<i>UFO 是真实存在的。</i>

00:38.773 --> 00:42.531
That means there could be
evidence of UFOs anywhere!
这意味着可能有
任何地方都有不明飞行物的证据！

00:42.532 --> 00:46.358
Let's go find some.
我们去找一些吧。

00:46.359 --> 00:48.117
Here, alien.
在这里，外星人。

00:48.118 --> 00:50.153
Alien! Alien!
外星人！外星人！

00:52.188 --> 00:53.842
- Hmm.
- Huh?
- 唔。
- 啊？

00:56.809 --> 00:58.291
Uh, huh?
呃，嗯？

00:59.843 --> 01:01.566
Huh?
啊？

01:06.567 --> 01:08.910
It's the middle of the night!
已经是半夜了！

01:08.911 --> 01:11.290
What are you two idiots doing?
你们两个白痴在做什么？

01:11.291 --> 01:14.531
We found an
alien crop circle!
我们发现了一个
外星麦田怪圈！

01:14.532 --> 01:16.841
It's only a crop circle
because you're
这只是一个麦田圈
因为你是

01:16.842 --> 01:19.600
stomping on my begonias!
踩我的海棠！

01:19.601 --> 01:20.841
Huh?
啊？

01:20.842 --> 01:21.876
Okay.
好的。

01:21.877 --> 01:23.496
Yeah, that is us.
是的，那就是我们。

01:23.497 --> 01:26.427
We're hunting space
aliens and UFOs.
我们正在寻找空间
外星人和不明飞行物。

01:26.428 --> 01:30.703
Space aliens and UFOs
do not exist.
太空外星人和不明飞行物
不存在。

01:30.704 --> 01:32.809
Go to sleep!
睡觉！

01:42.326 --> 01:44.186
Okay.
好的。

01:44.187 --> 01:46.462
You want to see space aliens?
你想看太空外星人吗？

01:46.463 --> 01:49.222
I'll show you space aliens.
我将向你展示太空外星人。

01:50.912 --> 01:53.739
This could
definitely be a UFO.
这可以
肯定是不明飞行物。

01:57.154 --> 01:59.393
A real UFO!
真正的不明飞行物！

01:59.394 --> 02:00.910
both: First contact!
双方：第一次接触！

02:00.911 --> 02:03.877
First contact!
第一次接触！

02:06.223 --> 02:08.427
both: Whoa!
两人：哇！

02:08.428 --> 02:09.910
Intergalactic.
星际。

02:09.911 --> 02:11.600
Spacey.
史派西。

02:11.601 --> 02:13.085
Cosmic.
宇宙的。

02:20.395 --> 02:24.669
We just got hit
by a flying saucer!
我们刚刚被击中
通过飞碟！

02:24.670 --> 02:26.255
- Yeah!
- Yeah! Cool!
- 是的！
- 是的！凉爽的！

02:26.256 --> 02:27.703
Cool! Yeah!
凉爽的！是的！

02:27.704 --> 02:30.083
Greetings, earthlings.
问候，地球人。

02:30.084 --> 02:32.979
A r-r-real space alien.
一个真实的太空外星人。

02:32.980 --> 02:34.808
Greetings, sir.
你好，先生。

02:36.257 --> 02:38.841
It's me, you tinfoil twits.
是我，你们这群锡纸傻瓜。

02:38.842 --> 02:40.496
It was all me.
都是我。

02:40.497 --> 02:44.048
Space aliens don't exist.
太空外星人并不存在。

02:44.049 --> 02:45.565
Got it?
知道了？

02:45.566 --> 02:47.048
Thank you, Squidward.
谢谢你，章鱼哥。

02:47.049 --> 02:50.945
We can see now how
silly we really were.
我们现在可以看到如何
我们真的很傻。

02:50.946 --> 02:52.186
I know.
我知道。

02:52.187 --> 02:54.117
Let's play superheroes instead.
让我们来扮演超级英雄吧。

02:54.118 --> 02:55.324
Yeah!
是的！

02:55.325 --> 02:58.256
At least we know they're real.
至少我们知道它们是真实的。

03:01.912 --> 03:03.292
Idiots.
白痴。

03:15.705 --> 03:20.738
At last, evidence of our
ancient aquatic ancestors.
最后，我们的证据
古代水生祖先。

03:20.739 --> 03:23.152
We must take the artifact
back to the ship.
我们必须拿走神器
回到船上。

03:23.153 --> 03:24.290
We'll be rich.
我们会变得富有。

03:24.291 --> 03:25.394
Rich, I say.
富有，我说。

03:26.809 --> 03:30.841
I told you two,
space aliens don't exist.
我告诉你们两个，
太空外星人并不存在。

03:30.842 --> 03:32.876
Go away!
离开！

03:32.877 --> 03:34.496
Oh, no.
哦，不。

03:34.497 --> 03:37.910
The artifact is infested
with a parasite.
神器已被感染
有寄生虫。

03:37.911 --> 03:40.979
We must eradicate it
before our departure.
我们必须消灭它
在我们出发之前。

03:40.980 --> 03:45.222
I'm telling you,
it's always something.
我告诉你，
它总是有一些东西。

03:54.774 --> 03:56.014
Huh?
啊？

03:56.015 --> 03:57.324
Who--who's there?
谁——谁在那儿？

03:57.325 --> 03:59.015
Ahh!
啊！

04:01.188 --> 04:04.394
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!
噢！噢！噢！噢！

04:18.809 --> 04:19.980
Ah-ha!
啊哈！

04:22.498 --> 04:24.531
My holes!
我的洞！

04:24.532 --> 04:26.291
Oh, my holes!
哦，我的洞！

04:30.050 --> 04:32.704
Thank Neptune
I have my readers.
评分此翻译： 感谢你的评分 不好 好
我有我的读者。

04:37.464 --> 04:40.084
Have SpongeBob and Patrick
gone cuckoo?
有海绵宝宝和帕特里克
杜鹃走了吗？

04:42.981 --> 04:44.705
You!
你！

04:49.395 --> 04:52.565
SpongeBob and Patrick,
take off those stupid masks!
海绵宝宝和帕特里克，
摘掉那些愚蠢的面具！

04:52.566 --> 04:55.876
I know it's you.
我知道是你。

04:55.877 --> 04:57.255
Stop it.
停止吧。

04:57.256 --> 04:58.565
You're hurting me.
你伤害了我。

04:58.566 --> 05:00.255
Mayday!
Mayday!
劳动节！
劳动节！

05:00.256 --> 05:01.497
We need backup.
我们需要备份。

05:07.464 --> 05:10.290
Will you two
shut up in there?
你们两个愿意吗
关在那儿？

05:10.291 --> 05:13.841
I'm trying to get your heads--
我正在努力让你明白——

05:13.842 --> 05:14.739
off?
离开？

05:16.498 --> 05:19.083
Those nimrods were right.
那些尼姆罗德是对的。

05:19.084 --> 05:21.049
Aliens are real!
外星人是真实存在的！

05:24.671 --> 05:26.600
SpongeBob, let me in!
海绵宝宝，让我进去！

05:26.601 --> 05:27.910
You were right!
你是对的！

05:27.911 --> 05:31.117
Tell Patrick you were right!
告诉帕特里克你是对的！

05:31.118 --> 05:32.703
Success.
成功。

05:32.704 --> 05:35.117
The vermin has evacuated.
害虫已经撤离。

05:35.118 --> 05:37.255
Let's take the artifact
to our ship
来拿神器吧
到我们的船

05:37.256 --> 05:40.497
before that horrible stinkbug
comes back.
在那个可怕的臭虫之前
回来了。

05:56.360 --> 05:58.152
No! Wait! Wait!
不！等待！等待！

05:58.153 --> 05:59.947
Wait, wait, wait!
等等，等等，等等！

06:12.395 --> 06:14.255
Hmm.
唔。

06:14.256 --> 06:18.084
So I says, I'll show
<i>you</i> a tractor beam.
所以我说，我会展示
<i>你</i>是牵引光束。

06:22.154 --> 06:24.772
All right,
who's in charge here?
好吧，
这里谁负责？

06:24.773 --> 06:27.324
I want to speak to the manager.
我想和经理谈谈。

06:27.325 --> 06:28.601
Manager?
经理？

06:30.016 --> 06:32.876
Take me to your leader.
带我去见你们的领导。

06:32.877 --> 06:35.427
That would be our supervisor.
那将是我们的主管。

06:35.428 --> 06:37.083
His office is down this hall.
他的办公室就在这个大厅下面。

06:37.084 --> 06:38.703
You just make a left
then a right.
你只需向左转
然后是一个权利。

06:38.704 --> 06:39.876
Don't talk to him.
别和他说话。

06:39.877 --> 06:42.221
He is the vermin we eradicated.
他是我们消灭的害虫。

06:42.222 --> 06:46.187
Looks like somebody
failed eradication class.
看起来像某人
消灭班失败。

06:49.085 --> 06:50.186
Zip it.
拉上拉链。

06:50.187 --> 06:51.772
I outrank you both.
我的级别比你们俩都高。

06:51.773 --> 06:55.186
I want you to put my home
back where you found it.
我要你把我的家
回到你发现它的地方。

06:55.187 --> 06:56.807
Could you step forward?
你能上前一步吗？

06:56.808 --> 06:58.462
I'm hard of hearing.
我听力不好。

06:58.463 --> 06:59.565
Sure.
当然。

06:59.566 --> 07:01.083
And another thing.
还有一件事。

07:01.084 --> 07:03.565
What's the big idea
of coming to my planet
有什么大创意
来到我的星球

07:03.566 --> 07:06.221
and taking my house
out of my yard
并夺走我的房子
从我的院子里出来

07:06.222 --> 07:08.532
just because it looked
like your stupid head?
只是因为它看起来
喜欢你的傻脑袋吗？

07:12.843 --> 07:15.634
Talking vermin are
the worst kind.
会说话的害虫是
最糟糕的一种。

07:15.635 --> 07:17.014
Am I right?
我说得对吗？

07:17.015 --> 07:18.807
Just so it's not
a total loss,
只是这样才不是
完全损失，

07:18.808 --> 07:23.634
I say we run some tests
and do a probe.
我说我们进行一些测试
并进行探测。

07:23.635 --> 07:26.255
Hooray!
We're doing a probe!
万岁！
我们正在进行调查！

07:26.256 --> 07:28.496
all: Probe! Probe! Probe!
全体：探测！探测！探测！

07:28.497 --> 07:30.324
Probe! Probe! Probe!
探测！探测！探测！

07:30.325 --> 07:31.876
Probe! Probe!
- Probe?
探测！探测！
- 探测？

07:31.877 --> 07:33.807
Probe! Probe! Probe!
探测！探测！探测！

07:33.808 --> 07:35.153
Probe! Probe!
探测！探测！

07:43.154 --> 07:44.395
X-ray.
X 射线。

07:45.843 --> 07:47.876
Despite the large cranium,
尽管颅骨很大，

07:47.877 --> 07:50.014
the brain seems
below average size.
大脑似乎
低于平均尺寸。

07:50.015 --> 07:51.187
Hey!
嘿！

07:52.912 --> 07:54.738
High blood pressure.
高血压。

07:54.739 --> 07:57.772
Better watch that temper.
最好注意一下脾气。

07:57.773 --> 07:59.878
Rotate neck.
旋转脖子。

08:06.740 --> 08:08.601
Nose hose.
鼻管。

08:17.223 --> 08:19.669
Impressive storage space.
令人印象深刻的存储空间。

08:19.670 --> 08:22.187
Now for the fun part.
现在是有趣的部分。

08:25.395 --> 08:26.635
Ahh!
啊！

08:30.774 --> 08:32.257
Freedom!
自由！

08:35.740 --> 08:37.807
all: Hut. Hut. Hut. Hut. Hut.
全体：小屋。小屋。小屋。小屋。小屋。

08:37.808 --> 08:39.566
Hut. Hut. Hut. Hut. Hut.
小屋。小屋。小屋。小屋。小屋。

08:46.292 --> 08:47.497
Huh?
啊？

09:02.119 --> 09:04.084
Daddy.
爸爸。

09:08.636 --> 09:10.154
Huh?
啊？

09:29.464 --> 09:30.565
No!
不！

09:30.566 --> 09:32.325
Please don't probe me!
请不要试探我！

09:38.567 --> 09:39.808
Huh?
啊？

09:46.154 --> 09:48.427
In this probe,
I will be asking you
在本次探查中，
我会问你

09:48.428 --> 09:51.634
embarrassing questions
about your childhood.
尴尬的问题
关于你的童年。

09:51.635 --> 09:56.292
Well, I guess I did have
trouble making friends.
嗯，我想我确实有过
交朋友有困难。

10:00.154 --> 10:02.910
Then when I was three,
I said, "Mumsy, I told you,
然后当我三岁的时候，
我说：“妈妈，我告诉过你，

10:02.911 --> 10:04.634
I don't like kelp juice."
我不喜欢海带汁。”

10:04.635 --> 10:07.427
And she said, "Well, I don't
like being called Mumsy."
她说：“好吧，我不
就像被称为妈妈一样。”

10:07.428 --> 10:09.981
And then--
all: Enough!
然后——
全体：够了！

10:18.429 --> 10:20.186
Good riddance, vermin.
祝你摆脱困境，害虫。

10:20.187 --> 10:23.117
Keep your dumb, old artifact.
保留你那愚蠢的旧神器。

10:23.118 --> 10:26.117
And you can keep your
mother stories too.
并且您可以保留您的
妈妈的故事也有。

10:26.118 --> 10:27.497
Oy vey!
哎哟喂！

10:29.360 --> 10:31.565
Squidward, if I
didn't know better,
章鱼哥，如果我
不知道更好，

10:31.566 --> 10:34.876
I'd be thinking that was
a real alien spaceship.
我想那是
一艘真正的外星飞船。

10:34.877 --> 10:37.496
But we do know better,
huh, Squidward?
但我们确实更清楚，
哈，章鱼哥？

10:37.497 --> 10:39.393
I was wrong, okay?
我错了好吗？

10:39.394 --> 10:41.221
Aliens are real!
外星人是真实存在的！

10:41.222 --> 10:43.910
I was on their ship, and I was
telling them about my mother,
我在他们的船上，而且我
向他们讲述我的母亲，

10:43.911 --> 10:45.496
and--and--and--and--
和——和——和——和——

10:45.497 --> 10:46.910
We get it, Squidward.
我们明白了，章鱼哥。

10:46.911 --> 10:49.703
Aliens don't exist!
外星人并不存在！

10:49.704 --> 10:51.256
But they do exist.
但它们确实存在。

10:52.498 --> 10:54.809
Of course.
当然。

当然。